    "title": "<p>Differential diagnosis of inborn error of immunity (IEI)-associated T-cell lymphoproliferative disorders (T-LPDs) and cutaneous T-cell lymphomas</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Alejandro Gru",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"938\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diagnosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">IEI-associated T-LPD</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 112.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">SPTCL</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 112.05pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">PCAETL</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 112.05pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Acral CD8+ TCL</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 112.05pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">PTCL-NOS</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">Epidermotropism</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">Occasionally&nbsp;+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 112.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 112.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">+++</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 112.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 112.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" 